        "description": "Hop on your **hoverbike** and go guns blazing in this story-driven single-player experience! **This is Retronika and it’s time to fight back.**\n\nFight through **chaotic traffic and vibrant cityscapes,** face off against towering metallic bosses, and drones, and prove who’s truly in charge in Retronika!\n\n\n# Expect Chaotic Battles\n\nEngage in high-speed battles, taking down drones and enemy vehicles as you progress.\n{2149126378814047}\n\n# Master Your Hoverbike Skills\nTake full control of your hoverbike while fighting through and **master your movement to survive!**\n{496307063009337}\n\n# Unravel the Mystery\nVenture into Planet Retronika, a once-friendly world that has now turned **hostile**, and uncover its secrets.\n{1038876124632578}\n\n# Upgrade. Customize. Dominate.\nGet the most out of your hoverbike with **powerful upgrades** and **personalize it** with different customizations!\n{506856348701488}",
